# CODEOWNERS — see https://docs.github.com/articles/about-codeowners
# Review routing for the officialunofficial GitHub org.
#
# Owners route to @officialunofficial/makechain, an existing provisioned
# team, so required-review routing resolves to real reviewers. If/when
# dedicated teams (@officialunofficial/mkit-maintainers,
# @officialunofficial/mkit-crypto) are provisioned with members, swap the
# assignments below for those teams.

*                                @officialunofficial/makechain

# Security-sensitive surfaces require crypto-aware review
/rust/crates/mkit-attest/        @officialunofficial/makechain
/rust/crates/mkit-keystore/      @officialunofficial/makechain
/rust/crates/mkit-rpc/           @officialunofficial/makechain

# CI + release tooling
/.github/                        @officialunofficial/makechain
/install.sh                      @officialunofficial/makechain
/scripts/                        @officialunofficial/makechain

# On-disk + wire formats — changes need spec sign-off
/docs/specs/SPEC-*.md                  @officialunofficial/makechain
/rust/tests/golden/              @officialunofficial/makechain
